            "id": 82629,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zamiast tworzyć nową zmienną, możemy ponownie przypisać oryginalnej zmiennej zaktualizowany ciąg znaków, kodując <code>special</code>. </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"special = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's special is pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"special = special.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pasta&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;pizza&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(special)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's special is pizza\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>special</code>.</p></body></html>"
