          {
            "title": "Occurrences ",
            "id": 82612,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy używamy <code>replace()</code> w ten sposób, zastąpimy wszystkie wystąpienia wartości w ciągu znaków, co możesz zobaczyć tutaj, kodując <code>print(july)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"june = \" /><text value=\"&quot;June sales target updated. Let's rock June!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"july = june.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(july)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"July sales target updated. Let's rock July!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>print</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>july</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy używamy <code>replace()</code>, metoda zastępuje wszystkie wystąpienia wartości w ciągu znaków.</p><p>Wyświetl wynik, aby konsola pokazała <code>July sales target updated. Let's rock July!</code></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"june = \" /><text value=\"&quot;June sales target updated. Let's rock June!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"july = june.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;June&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;July&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(july)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"june\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"July sales target updated. Let's rock July!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>print</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, <code>july</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
